Thunked libraries are overlaid at their paths in the RootFS only. Chromium,
Electron and many games load their own copy of the Vulkan loader from next
to the binary (RPATH $ORIGIN): FEX runs it emulated, and it only finds the
ICDs of host drivers it cannot load (VK_ERROR_INCOMPATIBLE_DRIVER), so
their GL on Zink and their Vulkan get no GPU. Overlays in the library
directories (@PREFIX_LIB@) now also match a file of the same name anywhere.

